---
---

<section class="cover">
  <div class="conf-strip">
    <span class="conf-tag">Confidential</span>
    <span class="conf-meta">Acquisition overview · for IT-services and consulting principals · do not redistribute</span>
    <span class="conf-doc">Doc-A24 &middot; rev 0.1</span>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap cover-wrap">
    <div class="meta-row top">
      <span class="meta-eyebrow">Acquisition opportunity</span>
      <span class="meta-doc">Assembly Industries, Inc.</span>
    </div>

    <h1>
      Buy the platform.<br/>
      Stop billing labor.
    </h1>

    <p class="lede">
      Every IT-services and consulting firm now competes with the foundation-model companies themselves &mdash; not just with each other. <b>Acquiring Assembly converts T&amp;M services revenue into platform-leveraged ARR</b>: same engineer ships 5&ndash;10&times; the work, marginal cost per engagement drops, gross margin shifts from 25&ndash;30% to 70&ndash;80%. The body-shop trap, retired in one transaction.
    </p>

    <div class="cover-cta">
      <a href="#process" class="btn btn-primary">
        Request the confidential overview <span class="arr">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:founders@assembly-industries.com?subject=Acquisition%20overview%20request" class="btn btn-secondary">
        founders@assembly-industries.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="sv">21</span>
        <span class="sk">
          <b>Infrastructure capabilities</b>
          <small>One platform replaces twenty-one vendor relationships</small>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="sv">8</span>
        <span class="sk">
          <b>Pre-built vertical agents</b>
          <small>Reg-E · FNOL · post-placement · vendor-onboard · 4 more</small>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="sv">90/10</span>
        <span class="sk">
          <b>AI-generated &middot; expert-human split</b>
          <small>Three-person team displaces a fifteen-person body shop</small>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="sv">~10d</span>
        <span class="sk">
          <b>From idea to live</b>
          <small>vs ~12 weeks to a prototype on the body-shop model</small>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cover {
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 540px at 85% -10%, var(--color-indigo-50) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(700px 420px at -5% 30%, var(--color-lavender-50) 0%, transparent 55%),
      #fff;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ── Confidential strip ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .conf-strip {
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 8px 32px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .conf-tag {
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }
  .conf-meta {
    flex: 1;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }
  .conf-doc {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* ── Cover body ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .cover-wrap {
    padding: 80px 0 96px;
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .meta-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .meta-doc {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .cover h1 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4.6vw, 58px);
    letter-spacing: -0.024em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .lede b {
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cover-cta {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* ── Hero stats ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero-stats {
    margin-top: 64px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
  }
  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
  }
  .stat:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .stat:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .stat { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100); padding-bottom: 14px; padding-right: 0; }
    .stat:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  }
  .sv {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .sk {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .sk b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .sk small {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
